            },
            "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nNo findings. The [GB200 functional defaults](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/284e78f7cb71fe5669394cfbc6bc844b5fab718a/src/megatron/bridge/recipes/qwen_vl/gb200/qwen35_vl.py#L142-L150) disable the inherited fusion setting after recipe construction. Both SFT and PEFT use this helper, and the [regression test](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/284e78f7cb71fe5669394cfbc6bc844b5fab718a/tests/unit_tests/recipes/qwen_vl/test_qwen35_vl_recipes.py#L1037-L1082) covers both while retaining their learning-rate and PEFT assertions.\n\nThis was a static review; I didn't execute tests. The external HybridEP implementation wasn't available for direct inspection.\n\n### Suggested test cases\n- `test_qwen35_vl_35b_a3b_gb200_functional_defaults` — run both existing SFT and PEFT parameters; expect the fusion flag to be `False`.\n- `test_qwen35_vl_recipes_build_strict_model_config[qwen35_vl_35b_a3b_sft_8gpu_gb200_bf16_functional_config]`\n- `test_qwen35_vl_recipes_build_strict_model_config[qwen35_vl_35b_a3b_peft_8gpu_gb200_bf16_functional_config]`\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:b01e759f4188ba7640b1ee1a697b23773cba51ed81cf9523df48da1af876da7c:8cc2cc0f91753c3cd9e076bd0704be0c601e5ed41d766601a9c95df4a43e18c2 -->",
